  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe \"callto\" protocol is not the safelisted schemes as described here: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/system-state.html#safelisted-scheme\r\nAs a result, his greatly restricts the PWAs since they can only register to the \"tel\" protocol, when native desktop applications can register to both. \r\n\r\nPlease consider adding safelisting \"callto\" as well.\r\nThank you.",
